        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Fingerprint The Filename",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Content-hash the name: `app.9f2c1a.js`",
            "Content changes, hash changes, URL changes",
            "New URL = new entry; old entries age out harmlessly",
            "Nothing to invalidate, ever"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "http",
          "lines": [
            "GET /static/app.9f2c1a.js",
            "Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000,",
            "  immutable      # 1 year, no revalidate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "One year is the practical maximum `max-age`",
            "`immutable` = do not revalidate, even on reload",
            "Without it a plain refresh still fires `If-None-Match`",
            "That is one wasted RTT per asset, per reload"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Weaker Alternatives",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Query busting `app.js?v=3` is weaker",
            "Some intermediary proxies refuse to cache query URLs",
            "Never fingerprint your HTML entry point",
            "HTML is the mutable index pointing at immutable assets"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Two-Tier Policy",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Resource",
            "Cache-Control"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "HTML",
              "`no-cache`"
            ],
            [
              "HTML (alt)",
              "`max-age=0, must-revalidate`"
            ],
            [
              "hashed asset",
              "`max-age=31536000, immutable`"
            ],
            [
              "API GET",
              "`private, no-cache` + ETag"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Deploy Ordering",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              "upload new assets",
              "flip HTML",
              "keep old assets 1 TTL",
              "then prune"
            ]
          }
